The White Diamond is a documentary film directed by Werner Herzog.

2
00:10:35,294 --> 00:10:41,294
This 2004 documentary by Werner Herzog diaries the struggle of a passionate English inventor to
design and test a unique airship during its maiden flight above the jungle canopy.

